{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_08_end",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_08",
  "title": "命运",
  "storyCode": "LE-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "041cc2845068f8e8e7d13b7bd8214332502fd5c49ad571fab022e556fbba127c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "傻孩子，真是个傻孩子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "你明明可以不用做这样的事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "这片大地欠你这么多，你又何必做到这一步？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "老先生？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "请您赶快离开！这里的源石活性正在不断上升！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "我还想见我孙子最后一面呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "就差最后一下了，芙蓉，拜托你牵制他的注意力——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "白垩，爷爷在这儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "您？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "白垩，我亲爱的孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "如果你觉得有怨气，就冲我来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "在你毁掉更多东西之前，先冲我来吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "我骗了你许多年，瞒了你许多年......我想过因你而死，却没想过你会遭遇这样的结局！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "既然你选择让其他人活下去，那就让时日无多的我随你而去，又有何妨？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "让我再陪你一程吧，我亲爱的孩子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石结晶组成的怪物不能理解老人的话。\n刚刚那瞬间的清醒已经是奇迹中的奇迹，此时的怪物只想随着大提琴声，将四周拖入永久的虚无。\n于是，怪物循着声音传来的方向，全力喷吐死亡的旋律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "老先生？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爷爷",
      "text": "小姑娘，你何必——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "——黑键，这里由我挡住，趁现在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "喝啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "怎么可能？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "友情、牺牲、奉献——如此幼稚的信念，就应该在现实中摔得粉身碎骨，凭什么，凭什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "不，还没有结束！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "白垩确实把两段尘世之音强行纳入了自己这一侧，可他最终还是敌不过它们叠加在一起的无序和疯狂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "我听得见，白垩的旋律已经消散殆尽，但黑键的尘世之音并未离去，我还——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特鲁德",
      "text": "唔呃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "够了，斯特罗洛伯爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格特鲁德刚刚搭上琴弦的手无力地垂下。\n别格勒把匕首从格特鲁德的后背抽出，血染脏了他的衣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石外壳层层崩解。\n广场上失去了声音，只有失去活性的源石外壳落在地上的沉闷响动。\n最后，外壳尽数剥落，留在原地的，是奄奄一息的白垩，还有他身边的大提琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "等着我......等着我！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "等等！他现在很危险，我们该做的是呼叫感染者临终事务处......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你说什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......白垩不会死的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "白垩，你醒了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "看到了吗，白垩有救的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "黑键......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我在这里，我在这里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "别......白费力气了，我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "（深呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我觉得......身体好轻......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "刚刚一直很痛，但现在好多了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "嗯，会好的，肯定会好的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "听好了，黑键，这是我最后一次跟你说话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "记着我的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "黑键，你要活下去，你要走过漫长的夜晚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "你要去反抗那些不公的命运，并且孜孜不倦地为他人付出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "只有这样，当你坐下来的时候，才会想到我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我会问你，黑键，你今天过得如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "然后，你会挺起胸膛告诉我，你又度过了充实的一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "你会向我倾诉你在行善过程中遭遇的障碍，以及抱怨命运始终不愿青睐于你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "但是没有关系，我会倾听你的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "因为你是那么努力，你当然可以去抱怨一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "只有这样，你才不会被这片大地上的苦痛所淹没，你才能在你的生活中获得安宁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "记着，黑键，我们曾经一同反抗了不公平的命，而我们得了胜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "所以，想到我的时候，你应当笑，而不是哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "嗯，嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "还有，对不起啊，黑键。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "我还没有想好......应该给你什么信物比较......好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你送我什么都可以的，求求你别死，求求你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "白垩，白垩......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "白垩！！！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "他们总有一天会摔得粉身碎骨的，但不是现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "友情、牺牲、奉献......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "他们可能确实有些幼稚，但至少有人会为他们掬一把同情泪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "但你呢，斯特罗洛伯爵？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "你亲手毁掉了自己和车尔尼之间萌生的友情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "你杀掉了自己的亲兄弟，还要嘲弄他的无能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "你想让别人为你奉献，可你给了别人什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "......实在太难看了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "我承认自己刚刚有些冲动，但紧急处理威胁大众安全的因素，这也是我的职责之一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "我会替你写一份翔实的报告的，斯特罗洛伯爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "晚安，祝你做个不用诅咒别人的梦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你的手在流血！难道是被源石结晶刺到了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "啊，好像......是出了点血。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你得立刻接受必要的救治——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "救治？现在要救治的是白垩啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "黑键，他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "别说那个词，芙蓉，我求求你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "他......毕竟是感染者，黑键，就当是为他考虑，如果你不想联系感染者临终事务处，至少找个密封性良好的房间......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我明白，我明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "就......音乐厅休息室吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "好，我送他过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "白垩，来，我抱你进去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑键小心翼翼地抱起白垩，身上被源石刺出更多伤口，但他无暇顾及。\n他抱着朋友慢慢失去温度的身体，就像抱着一个短暂而美好的梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "白垩，我们马上就到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "很快的，很快我们就到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩？",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你还——活着？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我这就带你出去，去找芙蓉——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩？",
      "text": "把我安顿在这座建筑里吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩？",
      "text": "如果你以后还能回到夕照区，你就会想起，你有一个很好很好的朋友，你和他在这里争吵过，欢笑过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩？",
      "text": "最后，你和他共同献上了一场精彩的合奏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不对，你不是白垩，你是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩？",
      "text": "但这难道不是你想要的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "老头，闭嘴，我不允许你这样玷污他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "白垩为了清除尘世之音付出了生命，可尘世之音......还在我的脑子里？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我警告你，如果你还想模仿他，我不介意在这儿把自己的头打爆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "脑海中的声音",
      "text": "（叹息声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "脑海中的声音",
      "text": "......我愚蠢的血脉啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "再没有什么声音出现在黑键耳畔。\n他只是抱着白垩越来越沉重的身体，一步一步地朝夕照厅的休息室走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我们到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我去做密封工作，你在沙发上躺好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "这里的沙发挺软和的，你躺着一定很舒服——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "沙发、软和......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你甚至没睡过家里的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......我大概真是感染了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "以前要花点精力才能用的法术，现在几乎不费劲。看来感染了也挺好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "好了，这样就差不多了。门等我出去再封上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "还有......什么愿望吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "纪念......对了，纪念。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "那把大提琴，我就拿走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我给你买的东西，现在我又要拿走，真是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑键的嘴唇动了动，没说出话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他静静站立片刻，弯下腰，轻轻把自己用惯了的长笛放在白垩身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你之前说想要一个钻了孔的硬币，可我现在只剩这把长笛了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "对不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "对不起......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
